# 6. Hydra should NOT become another Letta memory folder

This is the core distinction:

```text
LETTA
"What have I learned?"

HYDRA
"What has our Lab observed?"
```

Suppose Researcher-7 has done 100 jobs.

Letta may remember:

> I often miss requirement completeness unless I explicitly construct a checklist.

Hydra records:

```text
72 runs used explicit requirement matrix
quality mean .88

63 comparable runs did not
quality mean .74
```

The first is cognition.

The second is empirical organizational evidence.

