# 17. Use Letta Trajectory as the portable experience projection

This is almost perfectly timed.

Letta introduced `@letta-ai/trajectory` specifically because experience is fragmented across different harnesses. It normalizes sessions from Letta Code, Codex, Claude Code and others into a token-efficient agent-readable format, reportedly reducing token volume roughly 5× on sampled sessions. ([Letta][10])

So every completed Moltwork Run should produce:

```text
