# 41. Where each flywheel physically lives

| Flywheel            | Source data                   | Computation           | Output                |
| ------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------- | --------------------- |
| Worker learns       | Trajectory + evaluations      | Letta + `cg`          | WorkerVersion         |
| Lab learns          | All Runs                      | Hydra + Lab Scientist | LabInsight            |
| Briefing reputation | RunDependency + quality       | analytics             | asset uplift          |
| Reviewer reputation | Reviews + before/after        | analytics             | review uplift         |
| Skill reputation    | Skill usage + outcomes        | Hydra/analytics       | capability evidence   |
| Oracle improves     | opportunities + real outcomes | Oracle                | better market metrics |
| Market grows        | residual Run artifacts        | Market                | AssetVersion          |
| TEE trust           | exact Run config/events       | dstack                | attested receipt      |

That table is basically your core system spec.

